Subject: Authenticate HTTP and WebSocket proxy access when a server key is configured
Base-Commit: 97031ea81fee1b853e4cd89e5490b1be9f5ead55
Upstream: https://github.com/opensandbox-group/OpenSandbox
License: Apache-2.0

OpenShip requires an authenticated manager control channel. Upstream's
single-tenant proxy exempts HTTP and WebSocket requests even with an API key.
Enforce the configured key for both protocols and retain no-key legacy mode;
OpenShip preflight separately requires a configured nonempty server key.

